	(text "Each input reaches its Pico ADC pin through a filter capacitor and a BAT54S that clamps it\nbetween ground and 3.3 V, so a spike on the bike wiring cannot reach the GPIO."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.51 20.828 0)
		(effects
